# T039 — with cap-sai-srv6=false in fabric-compat-pins (patched live at 2026-10-11T19:07:26Z),
# the provider (redeployed from this tree: T017/T018 compat.KindNetwork) reconciles every
# Network in agentic-netops-intent past the compatibility gate into the apply stage:
# conditions show ApplyFailed (apply-stage), never CapabilityMissing/SchemaMismatch —
# FR-007: the SRv6 capability does NOT gate Network.

$ kubectl -n agentic-netops-system get cm fabric-compat-pins -o jsonpath={.data.cap-sai-srv6}
false

